# A whole conversation in Russian
subtitle: "One train ride to Moscow, start to finish in Russian: a seat, names, home, work, study, tennis, an opinion, a plan and a phone number."
tags: ["russian","russian conversation","small talk","speaking russian","russian phrases"]
teaches: ["phrases/about-me","phrases/opinions"]
thumb: "band \"Your first whole Russian conversation\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Lesson 100: a Russian story","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/100-russian-review-10.cast"}

## A whole conversation in Russian
level: basic
heading: false

    icon lena size 120 set twemoji x 80 y 450 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman hidden true
    text lena_name "Ле́на" #8f887c x 80 y 355 font_size 30 hidden true
