A: Меня́ зову́т Том: you've said that since lesson 21. Today it grows (@draw o_more@) into a whole conversation, start to finish.
    draw o_name

    erase o_name o_more

A: I'm on the train to Moscow, and a woman I've (@draw s_lena s_tom@) never met stops by the seat next to mine.
    draw train to_msk

    erase train to_msk

A: Listen first, with no words on the screen. Where is she going?
    draw ear

B: Извини́те, тут свобо́дно?
    highlight s_lena color #5b8c5a caption false

A: Да, коне́чно. Вы то́же е́дете в Москву́?
    highlight s_tom color #5b8c5a caption false

B: Да, домо́й. Я живу́ в Москве́. А вы?
    highlight s_lena color #5b8c5a caption false

    erase s_lena s_tom

    ask "Where is she going?" voice b options ["to London, for work","to St Petersburg, on holiday","home: she lives in Moscow"] correct 3 reveal.text "Да, домо́й. Я живу́ в Москве́." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833
        gloss: Yes, home. I live in Moscow.
        listen: Да, домо́й. Я живу́ в Москве́.
        right: Домо́й: home. Я живу́ в Москве́: she lives in Moscow.
        wrong: Домо́й is home, and я живу́ в Москве́ is I live in Moscow.

    erase ear

A: Now the same talk with the words, and on from there. Then (@draw tom_you@) tap Practise after the dialogue, and be Tom yourself.
    show lena lena_name tom tom_name

    draw talk1

    draw talk1

    draw talk1

    draw talk1

    draw talk1

    draw talk1

    draw talk1

    draw talk1

    erase talk1

    hide lena lena_name tom tom_name tom_you

A: Тут свобо́дно: is it free (@highlight n_free color #5b8c5a part ^Тут effect underline@) here? Said of a seat, with no word for the seat itself.
    draw n_free

A: So it ends in о, like за́нято on the phone.
    draw n_free2

A: And я изуча́ю ру́сский уже́ два го́да: I've been studying for two years.
    draw n_years

A: Russian says I study, because I still do.
    highlight n_years color #5b8c5a part изуча́ю effect underline

    erase n_free n_free2

A: And Tom is из А́нглии, из Ло́ндона: from England, from London. After (@highlight n_from color #5b8c5a part ^из effect underline@) из comes the of-ending.
    draw n_from

    erase n_years n_from

A: Lena answers my А вы? Then come hobbies, an opinion and a plan.
    show lena lena_name tom tom_name tom_you

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

    erase talk2

    hide lena lena_name tom tom_name tom_you

A: Но́мер телефо́на: the number of the phone, so телефо́н takes the of-ending.
    draw n_phone n_num

    erase n_phone n_num

    quiz "Someone asks: Кем вы рабо́таете? Which answer fits?" reveal.text "Я рабо́таю по́варом." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Кем: as what. So the job, with the with-ending: по́варом.
        wrong: Кем вы рабо́таете asks for your job: я рабо́таю по́варом.
        * Я живу́ в Москве́.
        + Я рабо́таю по́варом.
        * Я люблю́ те́ннис.

    erase question_2_stamp

    quiz "Finish the plan: Е́сли ___ тепло́, пойдём игра́ть." reveal.text "Е́сли бу́дет тепло́…" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Бу́дет: after е́сли, a plan looks ahead, so the future.
        wrong: A plan for Saturday looks ahead: е́сли бу́дет тепло́.
        + бу́дет
        * бы́ло
        * есть

    erase question_3_stamp

    quiz "On a train, you'd like the empty seat beside someone. What do you ask?" reveal.text "Тут свобо́дно?" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Извини́те, тут свобо́дно? Is it free here?
        wrong: Ask if it's free: тут свобо́дно?
        * Ско́лько сто́ит?
        * Кем вы рабо́таете?
        + Извини́те, тут свобо́дно?

    erase question_4_stamp

    draw q_book

    ask say_it "Я изуча́ю ру́сский уже́ два го́да." gloss "I've been studying Russian for two years." voice a show cue reveal.text "ру́сский уже́ два го́да" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 620 reveal.style label reveal.size 56 reveal.color #3d3833 reveal_at q_book test t1

A: Я изуча́ю ру́сский уже́ два го́да.
    draw q4_full

    erase q_book q4_full question_5_stamp

    ask "Now build a question. Type: What do you like doing? (to someone you call вы)" answer ["что вы любите делать","а что вы любите делать","что ты любишь делать","а что ты любишь делать"] reveal.text "Что вы лю́бите де́лать?" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 420 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys "АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ "
        right: Что вы лю́бите де́лать: лю́бите for вы, then the doing word.
        wrong: Что, then вы лю́бите, then де́лать: что вы лю́бите де́лать?

    erase question_6_stamp

B: Что вы лю́бите де́лать?
    draw q_tennis2 q5_full

    erase q_tennis2 q5_full

    group sum members ["sum1","sum2","sum3","sum4","sum5","sum6","sum7","sum8","sum9","sum10"]

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: A seat, our names and homes, work and study, tennis, an opinion, a plan and a phone number: from меня́ зову́т to до встре́чи, all in Russian.
    highlight sum color #5b8c5a effect underline

    erase sum

B: До встре́чи, Том!
    icon end_lena size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 480 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman
    text end_say "До встре́чи, Том!" say "До встре́чи, Том!" say_voice b x 500 y 290 font_size 60

    erase end_lena end_say

A: Next time: lesson one hundred, and our longest story yet.
    box next100 "Next: lesson 100 · a Russian story" x 500 y 430 width 740 height 130 radius 14 font_size 46

